  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Rebuilt as a single standalone event.projection node over the FluxFlow.Nodes kit: post FlowMessage<ProjectionEvent> in, rolling FlowMessage<EventProjectionSnapshot> broadcast out, failures on the error port, diagnostics on the event port. The engine glue (node factory, module, registration extensions, component-type/port constants, JSON options reader, and design-metadata provider) is removed; the node depends only on FluxFlow.Nodes and runs without the engine. ProjectionEvent replaces the engine FlowEvent as the standalone input contract; correlation flows event -> snapshot via the envelope.",
